This repository contains teaching materials (Jupyter notebooks, Markdown
documents, figures, and Bash/R scripts) written by Pierce Taylor for the
course PS4001/PS7001, Next-Generation Sequencing Analysis.

Except where noted below, no license is granted to copy, modify, publish,
distribute, sublicense, or sell any part of this repository. The material
is made publicly viewable as a portfolio. Viewing it, and forking it within
GitHub as GitHub's Terms of Service allow, does not grant any further rights.
For permission requests, please open an issue in this repository.

